'''''Eternal Freeze Aftermath''''' is a [[Companion Mission]] in the chapter [[Slices of Life Before the Furnace]].

==Steps==
# Talk with Gepard about the state of the battlefield
# Move deeper into the battlefield and help the refugees on the way
# Look for the little girl and other miners
# Keep moving forward and look for miners who have been separated from the others
# Keep pushing deeper into the battlefield
# Look for the little girl and other miners

